    "question": "<p>নিচের উদ্দীপকের আলোকে নিম্মোক্ত  প্রশ্নের উত্তর দাও: f(x)=cot x, g(x) = cosec2x\n<br/><br/>i. $\\int g({x\\over 2})dx=-2cot{x\\over 2}+c$</p><p><br/><br/>ii. ${d\\over dx}\\{f({\\pi\\over 2}-2x)\\}=2sec^22x$</p><p><br/><br/>iii. $\\int f(x)g(x)dx=-{1\\over 2}cot^2x+c$</p><p><br></p><p>নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?</p>",
    "options": [
      "i and ii",
      "i and iii",
      "ii and iii",
      "i, ii and iii"
    ],
    "answer": "i, ii and iii",
    "explanation": "<p>i. $\\int g\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right) d x$</p><p>$=\\int \\operatorname{cosec}^2\\left(\\frac{x}{2}\\right) d x=\\frac{-\\cot \\frac{x}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2}}+c=-2 \\cot \\frac{x}{2}+c$</p><p>ii. $\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{dx}}\\left\\{f\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-2 \\mathrm{x}\\right)\\right\\}=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{dx}} \\cot \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{2}-2 \\mathrm{x}\\right)=\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{dx}} \\tan (2 \\mathrm{x})=2 \\sec ^2 2 \\mathrm{x}$</p><p>iii. $\\int f(x) g(x) d x=\\int \\cot x \\operatorname{cosec}^2 x d x$</p><p>ধরি,</p><p>$\\begin{aligned}&amp; \\cot x=z \\\\&amp; \\Rightarrow-\\operatorname{cosec}^2 x=\\frac{d z}{d x} \\\\&amp; \\therefore \\operatorname{cosec}^2 x d x=-d z\\end{aligned}$</p><p>$\\begin{aligned} &amp; =\\int z(-d z) \\\\ &amp; =-\\frac{z^2}{2}+c \\\\ &amp; =\\frac{-1}{2} \\cot ^2 x+c\\end{aligned}$</p>"
